msgstr "解碼 {}"

msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

msgid "The analysis was cancelled."
msgstr "已取消這次分析。"

msgid "This image ({}) is too large to view. The result and the report export are not affected."
msgstr "這張影像（{}）太大，無法檢視。結果與匯出報告不受影響。"

msgid "inspect mode"
msgstr "單檔檢查模式"

msgid "no colour information"
msgstr "沒有色彩資訊"

msgid "sRGB (WebP default)"
msgstr "sRGB（WebP 預設）"

msgid "JPEG XL colour enum"
msgstr "JPEG XL 色彩列舉值"

msgid "{} (JPEG XL colour enum)"
msgstr "{}（JPEG XL 色彩列舉值）"

msgid "sRGB (sRGB chunk)"
msgstr "sRGB（sRGB chunk）"

msgid "partial colour information ({})"
msgstr "部分色彩資訊（{}）"

msgid "CICP {}"
msgstr "CICP {}"

msgid "embedded ICC profile"
msgstr "內嵌 ICC 描述檔"

msgid "unreadable ICC profile"
msgstr "無法讀取的 ICC 描述檔"

msgid "TIFF colorimetry tags"
msgstr "TIFF 色度標籤"

msgid "Pixel identical"
msgstr "像素一致"

msgid "Every sample is identical. The two files describe their colour differently, so the tool cannot prove the colours are the same."
msgstr "所有樣本都相同。兩個檔案描述色彩的方式不同，所以無法證明色彩相同。"

msgid "Colour source: original is {}; output is {}."
msgstr "色彩來源：原檔是「{}」，輸出是「{}」。"

msgid "This run used the suggested memory limit: job_commit_mib = {} MiB."
msgstr "這次使用建議的記憶體上限：job_commit_mib = {} MiB。"

msgid "Re-analyze with the suggested value ({} MiB)"
msgstr "以建議值（{} MiB）重新分析"

msgid "More than the memory available now ({} MiB). The analysis may fail or slow down the computer."
msgstr "超過目前可用的記憶體（{} MiB），分析可能失敗或讓電腦變慢。"
